      "value": "I confirmed that Quest is not crash or freeze in Unity 2018.4 version of VRChat.\nHowever, it is is not yet resolved that the screen go black and https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/vrcpanorama-not-function-properly-for-quest-users.",
