  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If a world have VRC_Panorama components to load image files total over about 15MB, Oculus Quest is frozen at “Initializing World...” then restart of the OS is necessary.\nThe number of VRC_Panorama components probably have no relevance.\nAn individual image file size also.\n \nDemo World: https://www.vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_a46e67be-fcf4-4007-b931-d1e1686f393d\n \nRelated by: [842] VRC_Panorama not function properly for Quest Users https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/vrcpanorama-not-function-properly-for-quest-users",
